  "content": [
    {
      "text": "greater light to rule the day … lesser light to rule the night, Gen. 1:16 (Moses 2:16; Abr. 3:6). husband … rule over thee, Gen. 3:16 (Moses 4:22). Lord shall rule over you, Judg. 8:23. He that ruleth over men must be just, 2 Sam. 23:3. ruled over all countries beyond the river, Ezra 4:20. Thou rulest the raging of the sea, Ps. 89:9. By me princes rule, Prov. 8:16. hand of the diligent shall bear rule, Prov. 12:24. better … he that ruleth his spirit than he that taketh a city, Prov. 16:32. He that hath no rule over his own spirit, Prov. 25:28. when the wicked beareth rule, the people mourn, Prov. 29:2 (D&C 98:9). one man ruleth over another to his own hurt, Eccl. 8:9. babes shall rule over them, Isa. 3:4 (2 Ne. 13:4). they shall rule over their oppressors, Isa. 14:2 (2 Ne. 24:2). righteous man from the east … made him rule over kings, Isa. 41:2. kingdom of brass, which shall bear rule over all the earth, Dan. 2:39. most High ruleth in the kingdom of men, Dan. 4:17 (4:25, 32; 5:21). mighty king … shall rule with great dominion, Dan. 11:3. that the heathen should rule over them, Joel 2:17. sit and rule upon his throne, Zech. 6:13.",
