      "text": "Governor, that shall rule my people Israel, Matt. 2:6. he that ruleth, with diligence, Rom. 12:8. he shall have put down all rule, 1 Cor. 15:24. let the peace of God rule in your hearts, Col. 3:15. ruleth well his own house, 1 Tim. 3:4. elders that rule well be counted worthy, 1 Tim. 5:17. Remember them which have the rule over you, Heb. 13:7. Obey them that have the rule over you, Heb. 13:17. he shall rule them with a rod of iron, Rev. 2:27 (19:15). child, who was to rule all nations with a rod of iron, Rev. 12:5.",
